      "content": "oh okay wow i didnt know that. thanks for the warning. actually the redness is spreading a little bit further up my leg now and it feels a lot more painful than just itchy, like a deep ache? i'm also feeling kind of feverish or lightheaded... do you think i should just keep going with the antifungal or is this something where i actually need to go to the ER?",
